<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-tw">
  <head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=11" />
    <title>3DS Challenge</title>
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="/acsn2_kernel/css/main.min.css"
    />
  </head>
  <body id=smsChallengeBody
        data-is-sms-verify-method="true">
  <noscript>
      <!-- <strong>without JavaScript enabled. </strong> -->
    </noscript>

    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="center-box">
        <div class="content">
          <!--- Loading - start--->
          <div id="overlay" class="overlay">
            <div class="loading">
              <div class="ds-spinner">
                <div></div>
                <div></div>
                <div></div>
                <div></div>
                <div></div>
                <div></div>
                <div></div>
                <div></div>
                <div></div>
                <div></div>
                <div></div>
                <div></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!--- Loading - end--->
          <!--- Dialog - start--->
          <div id="dialog-overlay" class="dialog-overlay">
            <div id="dialog" class="dialog">
              <div id="dialog-message-container" class="dialog-message-container">
                <div class="dialog-message-title">您確定要取消本次交易之身份驗證作業嗎？</div>
                <div>請按「取消」, 並輸入密碼完成本次交易。</div> <br>
                <div>請按「確定」, 將無法完成本次交易之身份驗證作業。</div>
              </div>
              <div class="dialog-button-container">
                <button id="dialog-cancel-btn" class="button dialog-button-cancel">取消</button>
                <button id="dialog-confirm-btn" class="button dialog-button-confirm">確定</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!--- Dialog - end--->

          <div id="logo-container">
            <div class="logo-container-left">
              <img
                alt=""
                src="data:image/null;base64,"
              />
            </div>
            <div class="logo-container-right">
              <img
                alt=""
                src="data:image/null;base64,"
              />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="logo-divider"></div>

          <div class="main-title-container">
            <div class="main-title-container-left">
              <span class="main-title">交易驗證碼確認</span>
            </div>
            <div class="main-title-container-right">
              <span class="main-title-language">中文</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="purchase-info-content text-align-left">
            <p class="font-16">特約商店：GreenWorld Technologies<br>交易金額：280.00 TWD<br>信用卡號：************9902<br>交易日期：2026/01/03 00:08:12</p>
            <p
              class="otpResultMessage text-align-left"
            >成功申請動態密碼，請檢視留存本行手機簡訊 0988***482或電子郵件信箱 並輸入密碼。</p>
          </div>

          <form id="verifyForm" method="post" action="/acsn2_kernel/2/browser/challenge-verify-otp">
            <input type="hidden" name="threeDSServerTransID" value="460a269b-3fc9-438f-a2f6-f86571e919fe"/>
            <input type="hidden" name="threeDSSessionData" value=""/>
            <input type="hidden" name="firstCReqRequest" value="eyJtZXNzYWdlVHlwZSI6IkNSZXEiLCJtZXNzYWdlVmVyc2lvbiI6IjIuMi4wIiwidGhyZWVEU1NlcnZlclRyYW5zSUQiOiI0NjBhMjY5Yi0zZmM5LTQzOGYtYTJmNi1mODY1NzFlOTE5ZmUiLCJhY3NUcmFuc0lEIjoiZTMwYmFmM2MtZWQ4MC00NmU4LTlhYWEtZjk0YzZjY2RhNmEzIiwiY2hhbGxlbmdlV2luZG93U2l6ZSI6IjAyIn0"/>
            <input type="hidden" name="authChannel" value="SMS"/>
            <input type="hidden" name="isResend" value="false" />
            <input type="hidden" name="languageValue" value="zh-TW"/>
            <input type="hidden" name="acsTransID" value="e30baf3c-ed80-46e8-9aaa-f94c6ccda6a3"/>

            <div>
              <div>
                

                <div>
                  <div class="font-16">請選擇網頁識別碼：</div>
                  <div class="radio-auth-id-container">
                    <div class="radio-auth-id-content-container">
                      <div class="radio-auth-id-sub-content-container">
                        <div class="radio-auth-id-btn-sub-content-container">
                          <input class="radio-btn" type="radio" name="selectedAuthId" value="LALP">
                        </div>
                        <div class="radio-auth-id-label-sub-content-container">
                          <label>LALP</label>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      
                    </div>
                    <div class="radio-auth-id-content-container">
                      <div class="radio-auth-id-sub-content-container">
                        <div class="radio-auth-id-btn-sub-content-container">
                          <input class="radio-btn" type="radio" name="selectedAuthId" value="KTRY">
                        </div>
                        <div class="radio-auth-id-label-sub-content-container">
                          <label>KTRY</label>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <span><br/></span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="radio-auth-id-content-container">
                      <div class="radio-auth-id-sub-content-container">
                        <div class="radio-auth-id-btn-sub-content-container">
                          <input class="radio-btn" type="radio" name="selectedAuthId" value="HYLC">
                        </div>
                        <div class="radio-auth-id-label-sub-content-container">
                          <label>HYLC</label>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      
                    </div>
                    <div class="radio-auth-id-content-container">
                      <div class="radio-auth-id-sub-content-container">
                        <div class="radio-auth-id-btn-sub-content-container">
                          <input class="radio-btn" type="radio" name="selectedAuthId" value="XECN">
                        </div>
                        <div class="radio-auth-id-label-sub-content-container">
                          <label>XECN</label>
                        </div>
                      </div>
                      <span><br/></span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="form-group">
              <input
                id="code"
                name="code"
                type="password"
                class="form-control"
                placeholder="請輸入網路刷卡OTP服務密碼(Please enter the password)"
                autocomplete="off"
                maxlength="20" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]*"
              />
            </div>
            <button
              type="submit"
              class="btn btn-block btn-primary mb-1"
            >送出(submit)</button>
          </form>
          <!---  輸入錯誤提示文字 --->
          <div class="color-red">
            <div id="errInfo"></div>
            <input type="hidden" id="errorNotInputMessage" value="請輸入OTP密碼"/>
            <input type="hidden" id="errorInvalidMessage" value="無效的OTP密碼"/>
            <input type="hidden" id="errorNotInputAuthIdMessage" value="請選擇網頁識別碼"/>
          </div>

          <form id="cancelForm" method="post" action="/acsn2_kernel/2/browser/challenge-cancel">
            <input type="hidden" name="threeDSServerTransID" value="460a269b-3fc9-438f-a2f6-f86571e919fe"/>
            <input type="hidden" name="languageValue" value="zh-TW"/>
            <input type="hidden" name="acsTransID" value="e30baf3c-ed80-46e8-9aaa-f94c6ccda6a3"/>

            <button class="btn btn-block btn-default mb-1">取消(cancel)</button>
          </form>
          <div class="text-align-center">
            <div>沒有收到簡訊OTP服務密碼？</div>
            <div>
              <form
                id="resendForm"
                method="post"
                action="/acsn2_kernel/2/browser/challenge-otp"
              >
                <input type="hidden" name="threeDSServerTransID" value="460a269b-3fc9-438f-a2f6-f86571e919fe"/>
                <input type="hidden" name="threeDSSessionData" value=""/>
                <input type="hidden" name="creq" value="eyJtZXNzYWdlVHlwZSI6IkNSZXEiLCJtZXNzYWdlVmVyc2lvbiI6IjIuMi4wIiwidGhyZWVEU1NlcnZlclRyYW5zSUQiOiI0NjBhMjY5Yi0zZmM5LTQzOGYtYTJmNi1mODY1NzFlOTE5ZmUiLCJhY3NUcmFuc0lEIjoiZTMwYmFmM2MtZWQ4MC00NmU4LTlhYWEtZjk0YzZjY2RhNmEzIiwiY2hhbGxlbmdlV2luZG93U2l6ZSI6IjAyIn0"/>
                <input type="hidden" name="authChannel" value="SMS"/>
                <input type="hidden" name="languageValue" value="zh-TW"/>
                <input type="hidden" name="acsTransID" value="e30baf3c-ed80-46e8-9aaa-f94c6ccda6a3"/>

                <button
                  type="submit"
                  class="btn resend-btn btn-block mb-1"
                >重新取得OTP服務密碼(Get the password again)</button>
              </form>
            </div>
          </div>
          

          <p class="font-13 text-align-left color-red"
          >1.	慎防詐騙!! 請先核對「交易金額」及「幣別」是否正確，OTP交易驗證碼資料請勿提供給第三人。<br />2.	請點選「取得簡訊OTP服務密碼」按鍵，台新銀行將於1~2分鐘內以簡訊傳送交易驗證碼。<br />3.	收到簡訊OTP後，請確認簡訊內「交易金額及幣別」正確性。<br />4.	「網頁識別碼」：請點選與簡訊OTP中相同的網頁識別碼(英文字組合) 。<br />5.	若您無法完成交易或是未收到交易驗證碼，請與台新銀行客服中心聯絡，電話(02)2655-3355。</p>

          
          
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <script crossorigin="anonymous" integrity="sha256-Xrw6AiXiVhUmlG1/dBKCQrWtIpEFd7n7DTyNLxovynA=" src="/acsn2_kernel/js/smsChallenge.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
